# Full-fold sq km formula is binding

Aled already set this. 3D Prime Full Fold area is:

full-fold length × (numStreamers × streamerSeparation / 2) / 1,000,000

Do not substitute adjacent sail-line / preplot grid spacing, settings.lineSpacing,
or swath width. Line Separation on the map summary is a display / offline metric
only; it must not feed sq km.

